-- Animation + VFX Logger (client-side LocalScript)
-- Logs every animation track that plays and every VFX instance that appears/turns on.
--
-- Animation entry buttons:
--   Copy    copy the AnimationId            Excl    hide it from the log (Filters tab to undo)
--   Run     play it on your own character   Block   auto-stop it whenever it plays
--   Stop    stop it where it's playing now  Detail  copy a script that REBUILDS the anim joint-by-joint
--   Code    copy a script that plays this exact AnimationId in any other game
--   RBXMX   save the animation as a .rbxmx KeyframeSequence file
--           (load it with: game:GetObjects(getcustomasset("file.rbxmx"))[1])
--
-- VFX entry buttons: Copy / Run / Excl
-- "Detailed: ON" auto-captures every new animation so the moved parts show up in the log.

